{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50625","headline":"句（朝天行） · 张建封","name":"句（朝天行）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赖有双旌在手中，镆鎁昨夜新磨了。\n（见李肇《国史补》卷上。\n）（〖1〗李肇《国史补·徐州朝天行》：「张建封自徐州入觐，爲《朝天行》。\n末句云：『赖有双旌在筘，镆鎁昨夜新磨了。\n』德宗不说。\n」〖2〗《新唐书》卷一百五十八《张报封传》：「十三年来朝，帝不待日召见延英殿，方会朝赴大夫班，以示殊宠，建封赋《朝天行》以献。\n帝眷遇异等，赐名马珍具。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张建封","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}